WEBVTT

00:05.710 --> 00:07.450
Rio! Aishia!

00:07.450 --> 00:08.500
Master?

00:08.500 --> 00:11.420
Thank goodness...
What's going on?

00:11.420 --> 00:13.610
I still don't know the details.

00:14.180 --> 00:15.950
Whether it's inside or outside the city.

00:15.950 --> 00:20.770
Either way, seems like a large number
of demons have appeared nearby.

00:20.770 --> 00:23.030
I think it's the minotaurs.

00:24.050 --> 00:25.570
What do we do?

00:25.570 --> 00:28.340
It's so sudden,
we don't know anything yet.

00:28.720 --> 00:31.470
We need to gather
some information first...

00:32.050 --> 00:33.090
Rio.

00:34.630 --> 00:37.060
Don't worry about me.

00:37.760 --> 00:41.440
I know I'll just be dead weight,

00:42.090 --> 00:46.010
but I can still pull my own weight with magic.

00:46.660 --> 00:48.440
So, um...

00:49.030 --> 00:52.090
You do what you think is best.

00:53.220 --> 00:55.200
Okay.

00:55.200 --> 00:59.590
Why don't we get changed
in order to be ready to move anytime?

00:59.590 --> 01:00.320
Yeah.

01:17.970 --> 01:20.520
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

02:20.550 --> 02:23.290
How charming, Master Haruto.

02:23.290 --> 02:24.210
Huh?

02:24.210 --> 02:26.790
What are you on about?

02:26.790 --> 02:29.130
Master Haruto, don't worry about her.

02:31.010 --> 02:35.260
AMANDE DEFENCE LINE

02:40.620 --> 02:42.530
We have demons outside!

02:59.200 --> 03:01.370
The gate is destroyed?

03:02.220 --> 03:05.060
That's quite a lot of demons.

03:15.180 --> 03:16.070
But...

03:16.860 --> 03:19.090
Amande's response is quick too.

03:23.040 --> 03:25.490
The backup troops just keep on spawning.

03:26.810 --> 03:27.860
This should hold it...

03:29.830 --> 03:34.150
Haruto, I detected a huge
amount of demons to the east.

03:34.150 --> 03:35.360
East?

03:52.500 --> 03:54.510
From the east too, huh?

03:59.050 --> 04:01.310
What's the plan, Haruto?

04:14.860 --> 04:17.150
Anyway, for now...

04:17.760 --> 04:20.590
Could you wait with Master in the room?

04:22.030 --> 04:26.160
The citizens are evacuating en masse
from the west to the northern ward.

04:26.160 --> 04:29.170
I can't watch over you
if you get out now.

04:29.790 --> 04:34.050
Maybe those from the east will
come evacuating as well soon.

04:34.610 --> 04:37.690
You should be safe inside for now.

04:38.430 --> 04:40.370
What will you do, Haruto?

04:40.370 --> 04:43.050
The defence on the east is thinning out.

04:43.620 --> 04:45.310
I'll try to block them off.

04:46.590 --> 04:47.810
Be careful.

04:47.810 --> 04:49.020
Thanks.

04:49.460 --> 04:51.810
I won't let any demons near you.

04:51.810 --> 04:52.850
Yeah.

04:52.850 --> 04:54.890
Leave Celia to me.

05:02.280 --> 05:06.290
EAST GATE

05:06.540 --> 05:08.250
Photon Bullet!

05:17.450 --> 05:21.510
That's a lot of demons...
Where's our reinforcements?

05:26.100 --> 05:27.420
Photon Bullet!

05:55.290 --> 05:56.060
Huh?

06:03.050 --> 06:04.680
Allow me to join in...

06:05.390 --> 06:07.140
...until backup arrives.

06:07.140 --> 06:08.690
Master Haruto!

06:08.690 --> 06:10.170
It's you, Chloe.

06:10.170 --> 06:12.880
Um, why are you here?

06:13.420 --> 06:15.940
I saw the east gate
being attacked second,

06:15.940 --> 06:18.610
and I thought the defence was weakening,
so I came to help.

06:19.280 --> 06:21.110
Thank you so much!

06:21.110 --> 06:24.000
Well, until our backup arrives,

06:24.000 --> 06:26.560
let's trim them down
as many as we can now.

06:27.350 --> 06:28.890
I'll go to the front line.

06:29.310 --> 06:30.370
Can I?

06:30.770 --> 06:33.280
Sure, please!

06:34.030 --> 06:38.380
The rest of you, please take care
of the demons entering the plaza for me.

06:38.380 --> 06:39.250
Okay!

07:09.160 --> 07:11.060
Wow...

07:11.060 --> 07:13.660
He took down that many with one strike?

07:16.420 --> 07:18.590
Anyway, we need information.

07:19.040 --> 07:22.150
Report everything to me,
no matter how trivial it is.

07:22.150 --> 07:23.150
Understood!

07:24.660 --> 07:28.420
We have a report from the observation tower
through the magic communication device.

07:28.930 --> 07:33.790
Seems like minotaurs and a lot of demons
have appeared at the east gate.

07:34.390 --> 07:36.700
They have broken through.

07:36.700 --> 07:38.850
What?!

07:39.460 --> 07:41.570
How far have they gone?

07:41.570 --> 07:44.370
The details are still unknown,

07:44.370 --> 07:49.740
but we are blocking them at the entrance
to the street facing the plaza at the east gate.

07:50.080 --> 07:54.050
But we're outnumbered there.
We should send backup quick...

07:54.770 --> 07:58.080
Even if we send our
rear guards and adventurers,

07:58.080 --> 08:01.420
they might clash with
the citizens going the other way.

08:03.060 --> 08:05.850
What about the attendants
we sent around the east gate?

08:05.850 --> 08:07.760
Can't we send them?

08:08.130 --> 08:11.630
We sent our main members
to the west gate,

08:11.630 --> 08:13.890
so it's only Chloe there now.

08:13.890 --> 08:18.580
There should be Cosette and the others
evacuating the people in the central area.

08:19.030 --> 08:21.560
Then you head there now.

08:21.560 --> 08:24.310
You can bring Cosette along the way.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.990
As you wish.

08:25.990 --> 08:31.030
I have Duke Huguenot's knights
remain in the manor.

08:31.650 --> 08:34.080
So don't worry about me.

08:34.660 --> 08:37.350
Just focus on your mission.

08:37.870 --> 08:39.210
Understood.

08:43.630 --> 08:45.950
Enchant Physical Ability.

08:50.410 --> 08:51.720
Lady Liselotte.

08:52.340 --> 08:54.710
It seems there's
an excellent knight arriving east,

08:54.710 --> 08:57.300
destroying all the demons alone.

08:58.060 --> 08:59.360
Is it Master Haruto?

08:59.360 --> 09:00.440
Perhaps.

09:01.750 --> 09:04.730
Seems like we owe him a big one again.

09:04.730 --> 09:08.610
But this is a great help.
Natalie is also heading there.

09:08.610 --> 09:11.930
I guess the east gate
should have enough force now.

09:20.090 --> 09:24.070
I can't believe we got in so easy peasy.

09:24.070 --> 09:26.740
Enough chit-chat, please.

09:26.740 --> 09:28.670
Ew, how cold.

09:28.670 --> 09:32.790
Why should I be getting
a cold shoulder on a battlefield?

09:32.790 --> 09:34.890
Humour me, will you?

09:35.370 --> 09:37.680
Fine, let's talk about work.

09:38.340 --> 09:42.750
When there's a signal from the minotaurs,
we'll start moving.

09:43.260 --> 09:46.480
Prepare yourself for the imminent departure.

09:46.480 --> 09:48.550
Sure, roger that.

09:50.110 --> 09:55.990
Now, I'm detecting the humanoid
spirit's presence up in the centre.

09:56.990 --> 10:01.770
I suppose the defence force
should be moving out to the front now.

10:10.930 --> 10:13.760
Wow... He's really amazing.

10:14.960 --> 10:18.090
Hey, who's that guy, Chloe?

10:18.090 --> 10:20.350
He's fighting alone over there.

10:20.950 --> 10:22.350
That's Master Haruto.

10:22.350 --> 10:26.100
He's Lady Liselotte's saviour
and an excellent knight!

10:29.650 --> 10:32.350
It's nowhere near excellent!

10:33.070 --> 10:37.590
But, as strong as he is,
he still needs rest.

10:38.130 --> 10:42.160
When that happens,
we must fight in his stead.

10:42.480 --> 10:44.420
Prepare yourselves!

10:44.420 --> 10:47.270
Okay! Leave the rear guard to us!

10:52.090 --> 10:53.380
Strange...

10:53.760 --> 10:58.510
Why aren't there any minotaurs
or humanoid demons?

10:59.170 --> 11:01.310
They could've broken through easily...

11:01.310 --> 11:04.490
...with their breaching force, no problem.

11:05.930 --> 11:10.490
With a minotaur, they didn't have
to try to breach from the gates.

11:11.650 --> 11:13.840
Do they have another aim?

11:15.610 --> 11:19.300
Aishia, is there anything strange in the city?

11:19.300 --> 11:20.780
Nothing in my view.

11:21.230 --> 11:25.350
The crowd is starting to clear out
a bit in the plaza.

11:25.350 --> 11:28.540
The evacuation should be over soon.

11:29.040 --> 11:31.100
Any change in the demons' movements?

11:31.700 --> 11:36.730
None. Seems like the west gate guards
have successfully held off the demons.

11:37.490 --> 11:38.930
I see.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.330
Thanks.

11:42.720 --> 11:44.220
I'll try to negotiate with them...

11:45.780 --> 11:47.110
...if I can return now.

11:48.480 --> 11:52.090
Okay. I'll call you if anything happens.

11:52.090 --> 11:52.860
Mhm.

11:53.780 --> 11:54.880
Chloe!

11:55.290 --> 11:57.920
Miss Natalie! Miss Cosette!

11:58.450 --> 12:00.960
Um, what's the casualties?

12:00.960 --> 12:02.220
Well...

12:02.890 --> 12:06.470
Master Haruto is fighting alone out there...

12:14.710 --> 12:16.460
Way to go.

12:16.460 --> 12:18.220
He is amazing, but...

12:18.860 --> 12:22.110
Shouldn't we call him back now?

12:22.110 --> 12:24.400
He keeps being on stage without respite.

12:24.400 --> 12:26.420
I don't think he'll have enough mana.

12:26.870 --> 12:28.230
You're right.

12:28.640 --> 12:33.320
Since we're here,
let's tell him to retreat.

12:33.320 --> 12:34.400
Master Haruto!

12:35.100 --> 12:38.250
Um, I remember you're Miss Cosette and...

12:38.250 --> 12:41.890
I'm Lady Liselotte's attendant, Natalie.

12:42.610 --> 12:47.690
Master Haruto, thank you again
for your help this time.

12:48.220 --> 12:51.370
I also thank you on behalf of my master.

12:51.830 --> 12:55.340
Don't mention it.
Actually, I have a request...

12:55.340 --> 12:56.950
What is it?

12:57.460 --> 12:59.990
My companions are standing by in the inn,

13:00.550 --> 13:02.710
and they still haven't evacuated, so...

13:03.470 --> 13:06.450
I want to go back to meet up with them.

13:06.450 --> 13:09.680
I see... So that's what it is.

13:11.180 --> 13:14.490
It might be impudent of me
to ask you to replace me,

13:14.940 --> 13:17.130
so I'll bring down that minotaur.

13:17.520 --> 13:18.710
What do you say?

13:19.310 --> 13:22.780
You're a civilian by law,

13:22.780 --> 13:26.180
so we have no means to stop you.

13:26.180 --> 13:29.290
But that thing is waiting on the back line.

13:29.680 --> 13:32.400
Don't worry, I'll finish it off from here.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.980
Come again?

13:33.980 --> 13:35.250
Here I go.

13:51.360 --> 13:53.770
I should go for
another strike just in case.

14:01.780 --> 14:04.720
All right, I'll be on my way, then.

14:04.720 --> 14:07.520
Okay, thank you very much.

14:09.340 --> 14:11.910
You're so charming, Master Haruto.

14:11.910 --> 14:12.770
Huh?

14:12.770 --> 14:15.510
Gosh, what are you saying?

14:15.510 --> 14:21.030
Master Haruto, don't mind her,
just go to your companions.

14:21.030 --> 14:23.070
Okay, then.

14:29.010 --> 14:32.980
WEST GATE

14:48.380 --> 14:52.870
The number of demons is clearly bigger than
when they attacked us in the forest.

14:53.230 --> 14:56.020
I'd love to sweep them all with a big spell...

14:56.690 --> 15:00.230
But if I don't consider the allotment carefully,
I'll exhaust all my mana.

15:01.120 --> 15:02.620
What do I do...

15:03.870 --> 15:07.810
But why are they not entering?

15:08.530 --> 15:09.820
This is confusing...

15:10.870 --> 15:15.460
It's a bit dangerous, but I'll just
launch myself upon them further.

15:23.860 --> 15:25.780
What's happening?

15:41.040 --> 15:45.010
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

15:49.940 --> 15:51.190
That's the sign.

15:51.190 --> 15:53.020
We're finally up, huh?

15:53.020 --> 15:55.010
Let us hurry.

15:55.010 --> 16:00.010
The demons acting as lures might
unexpectedly be wiped out earlier.

16:00.010 --> 16:02.020
You're the main actor here.

16:02.450 --> 16:05.490
We're counting on you, Alphonse.

16:06.500 --> 16:09.050
Yeah. Leave it to me.

16:12.910 --> 16:14.470
What the?!

16:20.390 --> 16:23.350
All hands! Stop them at all costs!

16:27.970 --> 16:30.480
I'll deal with the giant one!

16:46.320 --> 16:48.330
We should go now.

16:48.330 --> 16:49.260
This way.

16:49.260 --> 16:50.740
Haruto!

16:51.270 --> 16:52.370
That's a demon!

17:01.200 --> 17:02.710
Go away!

17:02.710 --> 17:04.170
Miraille, run!

17:04.530 --> 17:05.500
Oh, no!

17:11.670 --> 17:12.880
There's more?

17:29.730 --> 17:32.570
Thank you so much!

17:32.570 --> 17:36.120
My pleasure.
Glad you're uninjured.

17:36.120 --> 17:39.790
Thank you, Mister!

17:39.790 --> 17:41.860
Mom, are you okay?

17:41.860 --> 17:43.750
I'm fine.

17:44.110 --> 17:46.380
Mom? Miraille?

17:46.930 --> 17:49.150
Um, what happened?

17:49.150 --> 17:53.970
We were almost attacked by a demon,
but this mister helped us.

17:54.400 --> 17:56.810
He's so strong!

17:56.810 --> 17:59.670
Is that so?

17:59.670 --> 18:02.130
Thank you, Master Haruto.

18:02.130 --> 18:05.830
It's nothing.
Anyway, why are you here?

18:05.830 --> 18:07.670
Well...

18:07.670 --> 18:11.410
Some of the humanoid
demons have entered the city,

18:11.410 --> 18:14.210
so I was running to report to Lady Liselotte...

18:14.780 --> 18:16.620
Oh, Chloe!

18:17.200 --> 18:19.610
Mrs. Rebecca, are you okay?

18:19.610 --> 18:22.880
Thank you for earlier, Mister!
That was awesome!

18:23.290 --> 18:25.080
Um...

18:25.080 --> 18:27.050
I'm sorry.

18:27.050 --> 18:29.970
I'm in a hurry to report the situation...

18:29.970 --> 18:34.470
Could you hurry and evacuate
to the northern castle walls?

18:34.880 --> 18:39.580
If you tell the guards stationed at the gate,
they'll surely let you in.

18:39.990 --> 18:43.290
Okay, then. Off you go, Chloe!

18:43.290 --> 18:46.780
We'll evacuate together with this guy!

18:46.780 --> 18:48.770
Well, um...

18:49.580 --> 18:51.460
Let's go, Haruto.

18:51.460 --> 18:52.740
Cecilia...

18:53.200 --> 18:55.810
All right, let's go.

19:03.860 --> 19:09.300
So, do demons often attack cities?

19:09.300 --> 19:12.420
It's not that often, actually.

19:12.420 --> 19:14.950
But there are past examples.

19:15.490 --> 19:18.430
Before, there used to be
cities and villages...

19:18.430 --> 19:20.810
...destroyed by demons invading.

19:21.280 --> 19:22.500
I see...

19:29.270 --> 19:31.440
My apologies.

19:31.440 --> 19:33.760
I got so nervous, my throat dried up.

19:35.490 --> 19:37.260
NORTHERN CASTLE WALLS GATE

19:37.260 --> 19:39.370
NORTHERN CASTLE WALLS GATE
We're safe for now.

19:40.140 --> 19:42.970
Thank you for your help, Mister.

19:42.970 --> 19:45.330
I didn't do anything.

19:45.650 --> 19:47.570
I just walked with you.

19:48.050 --> 19:51.330
Could you be Master Haruto?

19:51.710 --> 19:54.310
That I am.
Why do you ask?

19:54.310 --> 19:55.380
I knew it.

19:55.380 --> 19:58.940
The fact is, if we spot you and your
companions among the people,

19:58.940 --> 20:02.100
we're told to prioritise you
for evacuation in the manor.

20:02.100 --> 20:05.040
That's the preemptory command
from Lady Liselotte.

20:05.670 --> 20:07.780
Oh, right...

20:09.450 --> 20:11.900
We'll take you and your
companions in our protection.

20:11.900 --> 20:14.080
This way, please.

20:14.480 --> 20:16.780
All right, we'll follow suit.

20:17.340 --> 20:18.720
Please lead the way.

20:19.250 --> 20:20.470
Understood.

20:25.070 --> 20:26.460
This way.

20:26.820 --> 20:30.080
It gets easier when you have a guide, huh?

20:30.410 --> 20:33.760
It's something a normal
strengthened revenant can't do.

20:35.950 --> 20:40.960
The guest living room is just
in the corner of the corridor.

20:41.600 --> 20:43.150
Copy that.

20:43.150 --> 20:46.600
All right, it's on you from now.

20:47.030 --> 20:49.360
Don't touch the princess, okay?

20:49.360 --> 20:54.170
Also, I guess you can bring pain
to the hero if you can't kill him.

20:54.170 --> 20:56.450
Yeah, leave it to me.

20:56.450 --> 21:00.610
I'm stronger than a minotaur now.

21:00.940 --> 21:06.910
Wow, I'm not sure whether
your head is still there or not...

21:06.910 --> 21:08.240
Someone there?

21:11.510 --> 21:12.980
Over here.

21:12.980 --> 21:13.990
Who goes there?

21:14.460 --> 21:18.700
Hey, I'm just here for a quick
business and go home.

21:18.700 --> 21:20.110
Don't mind me.

21:21.340 --> 21:22.090
Wait!

21:22.820 --> 21:23.840
Come out!

21:24.550 --> 21:26.350
Good grief...

21:27.490 --> 21:28.780
An adventurer?

21:28.780 --> 21:32.060
Are you alone?
Weren't you talking to someone?

21:33.560 --> 21:37.860
Well, I'm all alone, as a human.

21:40.320 --> 21:43.930
Hey, did something just bang the door?

21:43.930 --> 21:45.060
You're right.

21:47.450 --> 21:49.430
Hey, what happened?

21:57.030 --> 21:57.660
Huh?!

21:57.660 --> 21:58.960
What?!

22:00.580 --> 22:02.910
Demons?!

22:03.800 --> 22:06.610
What are they doing here?!

23:40.020 --> 23:40.950
NEXT EPISODE: THE FATED NEMESIS

23:40.950 --> 23:42.700
NEXT EPISODE: THE FATED NEMESIS
The Fated Nemesis.

23:42.700 --> 23:45.030
NEXT EPISODE: THE FATED NEMESIS

23:45.030 --> 23:46.310
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

23:46.310 --> 23:47.740
IT'S-A-ME, ALPHONSE

23:47.740 --> 23:51.110
ILLUSTRATION BY: FUTAGO MINAZUKI
